percentage of their max health over time.", "notes_zh": ["伤害不会禁用像闪烁匕首等物品。", "不能作用于远古生物。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {"scepter": {"zh": "竭心光环的生命流失伤害提升，数值为瘟疫法师当前生命恢复的%heal_regen_to_damage%%%。", "en": "Heartstopper Aura's Health Decay is increased by %heal_regen_to_damage%%% of Necrophos's current health regeneration."}}, "is_passive": true, "value_names": ["aura_radius", "aura_damage", "heal_reduction_pct", "heal_regen_to_damage"]}, {"subject": "necrolyte_death_seeker", "name_zh": "瘟疫法师·死亡搜寻", "name_en": "Death Seeker", "description_zh": "瘟疫法师变成一个大死亡脉冲，向目标单位的地点移动。到达该地点后，死亡脉冲会扩散至附近敌人和友军。", "description_en": "Necrophos turns into a large Death Pulse towards the target unit's position. Once it arrives to the location, the Death Pulse spreads towards nearby enemies and allies.", "notes_zh": ["不会触发法术反弹。"], "granted_by": "shard", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["projectile_multiplier", "ethereal_duration", "magic_resistance_reduction", "AbilityCastRange", "AbilityCastPoint", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"]}, {"subject": "necrolyte_sadist", "name_zh": "瘟疫法师·施虐之心", "name_en": "Sadist", "description_zh": "瘟疫法师每次击杀单位都将获得可叠加的恢复效果，持续%regen_duration%秒。击杀英雄后获得数倍的效果。", "description_en": "Necrophos gains stacking regen for %regen_duration% seconds for each unit he kills. Hero kills multiply the effect.", "notes_zh": ["破坏会使技能无法获得新的叠加效果。", "破坏不会使现有叠加效果提供的加成失效。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": true, "value_names": ["regen", "hero_multiplier", "regen_duration"]}, {"subject": "necrolyte_reapers_scythe", "name_zh": "瘟疫法师·死神镰刀", "name_en": "Reaper's Scythe", "description_zh": "眩晕目标敌方英雄，然后造成基于他当前损失生命值的伤害。瘟疫法师击杀敌人后将永久获得生命和魔法恢复。如果目标在死神镰刀效果下死亡，击杀者为瘟疫法师。", "description_en": "Stuns the target enemy hero, then deals damage based on how much life it is missing. If Necrophos kills an enemy this way, he'll permanently gain Health and Mana Regen. Any kill under this effect is credited to Necrophos.", "notes_zh": ["伤害在眩晕结束后结算。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["damage_per_health", "stun_duration", "hp_per_kill", "mana_per_kill", "AbilityCastRange", "AbilityCastPoint", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"]}, {"subject": "warlock_fatal_bonds", "name_zh": "术士·致命连接", "name_en": "Fatal Bonds", "description_zh": "将数个可见的敌方单位连接在一起，其中一人所受伤害的一定百分比会被其他所有人感受到。", "description_en": "Binds several visible enemy units together, causing a percentage of the damage dealt to one of them to be felt by the others.", "notes_zh": ["共享伤害的类型与原伤害相同。", "这个技能造成的伤害被视为反弹伤害。反弹伤害不提供任何吸血，而且无法反弹。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["count", "damage_share_percentage", "duration", "search_aoe", "AbilityCastRange", "AbilityCastPoint", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"]}, {"subject": "warlock_shadow_word", "name_zh": "术士·暗言术", "name_en": "Shadow Word", "description_zh": "术士低声说出一个咒语，对一个单位施展法术，使周围的敌方单位受到伤害，周围的友方单位被治疗。目标单位也会被治疗或受到伤害，取决于他是友军还是敌人。", "description_en": "Warlock whispers an incantation, casting a spell on a unit that makes it deal damage to nearby enemy units and heal nearby ally units. Target Unit will also heal or be damaged depending on whether they are ally or enemy.", "notes_zh": [], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["damage", "duration", "tick_interval", "spell_aoe", "shard_movement_speed_pct", "AbilityCastRange", "AbilityCastPoint", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"]}, {"subject": "warlock_upheaval", "name_zh": "术士·剧变", "name_en": "Upheaval", "description_zh": "持续施法 - 随施法时间增强的减速气流，还会造成伤害。持续最多%abilitychanneltime%秒。在魔法结束或目标离开生效区域后，敌人仍会被减速%duration%秒。", "description_en": "CHANNELED - A powerful slowing and damaging current that grows stronger as it's channeled. Lasts up to %abilitychanneltime% seconds. Enemies are slowed for %duration% second after leaving the area or the spell ends.", "notes_zh": ["减速效果的增加是根据持续施法的时长，而不是敌人在区内停留的持续时间。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {"shard": {"zh": "持续施法时每%imps_interval%秒术士会召唤一个魔童，持续%minor_imp_duration%秒，魔童死亡时会爆炸，对周围所有敌人造成伤害。", "en": "While channeling, Warlock spawns a minor imp every %imps_interval% seconds that lasts for %minor_imp_duration% seconds and explodes dealing damage to all enemies around them upon death."}}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["aoe", "slow_per_second", "duration", "max_slow", "aspd_per_second", "base_damage", "damage_per_second", "max_damage", "damage_tick_interval", "imps_interval", "minor_imp_duration", "AbilityCastRange", "AbilityChannelTime", "AbilityCastPoint", "AbilityManaCost"]}, {"subject": "warlock_eldritch_summoning", "name_zh": "术士·邪术召唤", "name_en": "Eldritch Summoning", "description_zh": "只要敌方单位在受到一个或多个术士的技能作用下阵亡，就会召唤出一个魔童，持续%minor_imp_duration%秒，死亡时会爆炸。魔童会自动搜寻附近单位，优先选择致命连接下的英雄，到达猎物时就会爆炸。", "description_en": "Whenever an enemy unit dies while afflicted by one or more of Warlock's abilities, a minor imp is summoned that lasts for %minor_imp_duration% seconds and explodes on death. Imps will automatically seek out nearby units, favoring fatally bonded heroes, and will explode when reaching their prey.", "notes_zh": [], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {"shard": {"zh": "提升小魔童的生命值和爆炸伤害。", "en": "Increases the health and explosion damage of minor imps."}}, "is_passive": true, "value_names": ["minor_imp_duration", "imp_health", "imp_explode", "imp_speed", "tooltip_imp_explode_radius"]}, {"subject": "warlock_rain_of_chaos", "name_zh": "术士·混乱之祭", "name_en": "Chaotic Offering", "description_zh": "从深渊召唤一个地狱火，眩晕敌人%stun_duration%秒。地狱火持续%golem_duration%秒，能够减免部分技能的伤害，具有较高的减速抗性，拥有永久献祭和烈焰之拳技能。", "description_en": "Summons a Golem from the depths, stunning enemies for %stun_duration% seconds. The Golem lives %golem_duration% seconds, takes reduced damage from spells, has increased Slow Resistance, has Permanent Immolation and Flaming Fists on attack.", "notes_zh": ["该技能将摧毁作用范围内的树木。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {"scepter": {"zh": "召唤%number_of_golems_scepter%个地狱火。", "en": "Calls %number_of_golems_scepter% Golems."}}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["golem_duration", "stun_duration", "aoe", "golem_hp", "golem_dmg", "golem_armor", "golem_movement_speed", "golem_health_regen", "golem_gold_bounty", "stun_delay", "number_of_golems_scepter", "golem_hp_scepter", "golem_dmg_scepter", "golem_gold_bounty_scepter", "bonus_armor"]}, {"subject": "beastmaster_wild_axes", "name_zh": "兽王·野性之斧", "name_en": "Wild Axes", "description_zh": "兽王投出他的斧头然后召回它们，切开飞过的敌人和树木。每把飞斧对同一个敌人只能击中一次，并且加深来自兽王和其单位的伤害。", "description_en": "Beastmaster sends his axes flying and calls them home again, slicing through enemy units and trees along their path.  Each axe can hit an enemy once, and amplifies subsequent damage from Beastmaster and his units.", "notes_zh": ["此技能将摧毁树木。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {"shard": {"zh": "兽王对敌方英雄的攻击还会施加相应等级的野性之斧负面状态。", "en": "Beastmaster's attacks on enemy heroes also apply the Wild Axes debuff of its corresponding level."}}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["radius", "spread", "range", "axe_damage", "duration", "damage_amp", "min_throw_duration", "max_throw_duration", "apply_debuff_on_attack", "AbilityCastRange", "AbilityCastPoint", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"]}, {"subject": "beastmaster_summon_razorback", "name_zh": "兽王·召唤刀背兽", "name_en": "Summon Razorback", "description_zh": "兽王召唤一头豪猪前来助阵。豪猪拥有被动的毒素攻击，可以减缓攻击和移动速度。", "description_en": "Beastmaster calls forth a Boar to aid in the battlefield. The Boar has a passive poison attack that slows attack and movement speeds.", "notes_zh": [], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["duration", "boar_base_max_health", "boar_base_damage", "boar_total_damage_tooltip", "boar_bonus_damage", "boar_base_xp_bounty", "boar_base_movespeed", "boar_moveslow_tooltip", "boar_poison_duration_tooltip", "AbilityCastPoint", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"]}]
